Mobile Support:
antd-mobile (v5.x) for mobile-native components
Desktop: antd + SCSS modules (unchanged)
Mobile: antd-mobile + Tailwind CSS (new layer)
Icons: react-icons/lu (Lucide) only — never mix icon sets
ICP: Non-tech SMB owner — zero jargon, large touch targets, instant feedback

Mobile Rules (MANDATORY for every new feature):
1. Every feature MUST have [feature-name]_mobile-support.md
2. Feature Admission Test (4 gates): Frequency, Speed, Touch, Value — all must pass for mobile
3. DAL-first: DAL → Hook → Desktop UI → Mobile UI (if operational)
4. Mobile inherits: auth (NextAuth), localization (next-intl, RTL), settings (theme, language, timezone from Redux)
5. No desktop refactoring — mobile is a new clean layer using existing shared logic
6. Optimistic updates required on mobile — UI updates instantly, backend syncs after